<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Become A Member</title>
</head>
<body>
    <section>
        <h1>Joining The Club</h1>
        <p>
            <h2>Why Join the Club?</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Know Who's Who: See who authored each post.</li>
                <li>Insider Status: Become part of an exclusive community.</li>
                <li>Bragging Rights: You're officially one of the cool kids.</li>
                <li>Secret Knowledge: Access information the public isn't ready for.</li>
            </ul>
        </p>
        <p>
            <h2>The Downsides</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Responsibility: With great membership comes great responsibility.</li>
                <li>Too Much Knowledge: You may discover things you were never meant to know.</li>
                <li>Membership Pressure: Your non-member friends may start asking questions.</li>
                <li>No Going Back: Okay, technically you can leave. We're not monsters.</li>
                <li>Potential Ego Inflation: You might start feeling a little too important.</li>
            </ul>
        </p>
    </section>
    <form action="membership" method="post">
        <p>
        <h3>The Secret Club Riddle</h3>
        I have a thousand faces, yet I wear no mask.

        I open doors without a key,

        I guard the words you're not meant to see.

        The more you share me, the weaker I grow.

        What am I?
    </p>
    <p>Hint: The club's secret depends on keeping me hidden.</p> <!-- i should add a hover effect on this  -->
    <label for="pass">Enter the password : </label>
    <input type="text" id="pass" name="pass">
    <button type="submit">Enter</button>
    </form>
    
</body>
</html>